{"availability":"available","full":"butterlatte-zhang/afkoi","name":"afkoi","description":"🎣 Your AI agents' working hours, turned into fishing. A playful usage tracker & global leaderboard for Claude Code / Codex / Gemini — desktop pet + zero-backend pond on GitHub Pages.","category":"Developer tools","language":"JavaScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-08-21T07:36:58Z","updated":"2026-08-24T02:44:42Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://butterlatte-zhang.github.io/afkoi/","topics":["ai-agents","claude-code","codex","desktop-pet","electron","fishing-game","gemini-cli","github-pages","leaderboard","pixel-art","usage-tracker"],"demo":"https://butterlatte-zhang.github.io/afkoi/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T20:10:19.322Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T20:10:19.322Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T20:10:19.322Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T20:10:19.322Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Your AI agents' working hours, turned into fishing.","AFKoi is a playful usage tracker and global leaderboard for AI coding agents. Every turn, tool call, and active hour your agents (Claude Code / Codex / Gemini) rack up becomes fishing energy — a little desktop robot fishes with it, your catches build a dex, and your real agent activity decides your rank on the global leaderboard."],"features":["A stat you can watch: instead of a dashboard, your agent activity is a pond on your desktop — the busier your agents, the harder the little robot fishes. Rare catches literally mean \"my agents worked a lot this week.\"","A leaderboard that means something: the global pond ranks people by real, measured agent activity (log-compressed so grinders don't drown everyone) — rendered live from everyone's data on GitHub Pages, no backend.","Zero intrusion: activity is observed passively from agent logs and processes. No window injection, no MCP, no slowdown — close the pet anytime, your agents never notice.","Privacy: only counts and stats ever leave your machine — never prompts, code, or paths."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/butterlatte-zhang/afkoi/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"fb9e073f126a8de82572f90611a831e1b0715347e4e6e27b0e4c6b4f27f08158","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T20:10:19.406Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T20:10:19.406Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Your AI agents' working hours, turned into fishing.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/butterlatte-zhang/afkoi/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"GitHub CLI (recommended, fully automatic): brew install gh && gh auth login — the pet creates and updates your Gist and registers you automatically.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/butterlatte-zhang/afkoi/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"fb9e073f126a8de82572f90611a831e1b0715347e4e6e27b0e4c6b4f27f08158","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/butterlatte-zhang/afkoi/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T20:10:19.406Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-08-24T02:44:42Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/butterlatte-zhang/afkoi/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T20:10:19.407Z","hash":"fb9e073f126a8de82572f90611a831e1b0715347e4e6e27b0e4c6b4f27f08158","originalBytes":4392,"storedBytes":4392,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["activity","gist","agents","github","leaderboard","pet","afkoi","agent","only","own","pond","desktop","dex","don","fishing","global","just","log-compressed","numbers","open","releases","windows","active","afkoi.app","afkoi.json","app","auth","busy","catches","click","code","data","dmg","energy","ever","everyone","hours","install","issue","leaderboard.","little","machine","macos","never","one","opens","pages","pnpm","real","registration","robot","run","ssh","sync","tool","unsigned","updates","activity-driven","again","agents.","anyone","anytime","anyway","anyway.","appear","appimage","apple"